      en: ["The total height of the waterfall is 422 meters.", "The longest drop is approximately 281 meters.", "The waterfall is located at an altitude of about 1,700 m.", "It is supplied by water from Lac Glacé in Spain.", "The site has been a UNESCO World Heritage site since 1997.", "Victor Hugo famously described it as 'nature's colosseum'."],
