      en: ["The systematic replanting was initiated by Colbert in 1670.", "The forest covers a total area of approximately 10,600 hectares.", "Several oak trees in the forest are over 400 years old.", "The wood is used for the world's most expensive wine barrels.", "It is located in the Allier department in the Auvergne region.", "The forest is home to more than 40 pairs of short-toed snake eagles."],
